{"mode":"words","text":"To tłumaczenie słowo w słowo nazywa się „dekodowaniem”. Brzmi ono celowo niezgrabnie — bo właśnie w ten sposób widzisz, jak naprawdę zbudowany jest język, zupełnie bez wkuwania zasad gramatycznych. Kiedyś robiło się to ręcznie, korzystając ze słownika, i zajmowało to całe godziny. W LinguaFlow aplikacja całkowicie przejmuje ten etap za Ciebie — w przypadku każdego tekstu, którego chcesz się nauczyć.","words":[{"s":0,"e":221},{"s":279,"e":1068},{"s":1126,"e":1533},{"s":1579,"e":1614},{"s":1672,"e":2264},{"s":2670,"e":3251},{"s":3355,"e":3587},{"s":3750,"e":5375},{"s":6246,"e":6606},{"s":6676,"e":6908},{"s":6954,"e":7488},{"s":7546,"e":8429},{"s":8615,"e":8707},{"s":8975,"e":9125},{"s":9183,"e":9718},{"s":9752,"e":9787},{"s":9845,"e":10066},{"s":10170,"e":10902},{"s":11447,"e":12249},{"s":12434,"e":12620},{"s":12748,"e":13955},{"s":14303,"e":15162},{"s":15220,"e":15406},{"s":15464,"e":16370},{"s":16637,"e":17624},{"s":17682,"e":17879},{"s":17937,"e":18750},{"s":18878,"e":19505},{"s":19574,"e":20793},{"s":21664,"e":22024},{"s":22128,"e":22488},{"s":22535,"e":22674},{"s":22802,"e":22918},{"s":22976,"e":23916},{"s":24044,"e":24950},{"s":24984,"e":25089},{"s":25124,"e":26215},{"s":26761,"e":26819},{"s":26889,"e":27550},{"s":27620,"e":27713},{"s":27841,"e":28421},{"s":28526,"e":29361},{"s":30755,"e":30813},{"s":30882,"e":31533},{"s":32183,"e":33262},{"s":33611,"e":34412},{"s":34470,"e":35062},{"s":35108,"e":35283},{"s":35410,"e":35898},{"s":36084,"e":36258},{"s":36327,"e":36815},{"s":37001,"e":37117},{"s":37384,"e":37419},{"s":37477,"e":38011},{"s":38069,"e":38591},{"s":38684,"e":39567},{"s":39752,"e":40275},{"s":40298,"e":40681},{"s":40728,"e":40879},{"s":41006,"e":42167}]}